</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==
''[[Lumi Stergnon]] is located at -640, -90 in the Temple of Divine Light.''

You say, 'Hail, Lumi Stergnon'

: Lumi Stergnon says 'Peace and tranquility be with you. ______. Are you a [new acolyte of peace] or are you [here to pay homage] to the child of tranquility?'

You say, 'I am a new acolyte of peace.'

: Lumi Stergnon says 'Then you shall learn the ways of Quellious and learn to do as you are told by higher ranking members. It is time for you to do the lesser duties of a young priest. Which will it be? [Retrieve the Peacekeeper staffs] or [battle the undead]?'

You say, 'I will retrieve the Peacekeeper staffs.'
(You must have high Amiable faction with the PeaceKeepers to get this part)
: Lumi Stergnon says 'Then take this note to the woodworker in Toxxulia Forest. His name is Emil Parsinsi. He shall have the staff to be returned to the temple.'

'''You receive A Sealed Letter (identifies as "Note For Emil Parsin"). It reads:'''

 Hail Emil Parsini, I have sent this new member of the Temple of Light to retrieve our delivery of the Peacekeeper Staff.
 Please see that the staff is given to this member. Lumi Stergnon

''[[Emil Parsini]] is located at 2119, 423 in Toxxulia Forest, in a hut just outside of Erudin.'' 

You say, 'Hail, Emil Parsini'

: Emil Parsini says 'Good to meet you, ______. Please look around. I have much to offer. I am a master woodworker. It runs in the Parsini family.'

'''Hand him the letter.'''

: Emil Parsini says 'I have been waiting for someone to come and retrieve this staff. Here you are. You will have to combine it with treant resin and an Odus pearl. You can find Odus pearls in the water in the harbor. As for the resin, I can make it if you can find me some treant shards. Maybe another woodworker or cobbler in Qeynos has some.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Council of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Guard of Erudin]] got better.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

'''You receive a Peacekeeper Staff, a 2-slot container.'''

*'''[[Pearl of Odus]] are found as ground spawns underwater in the harbor of Erudin at (-275, -460); (-215, -475); and (+5, -485).'''<br>

*'''Each Pearl looks like a bag on the ground and is guarded by [[A sand shark]] that is about level 8. None of the KoS sharks in the water see invisibility.'''

*'''Pearls can be collected before you make the trip to Qeynos to The Cobbler.'''

''[[Gerault Takenmaul]] is located at -70, +10 in The Cobbler in North Qeynos.''

You say, 'Hail, Gerault Takenmaul'

: Gerault Takenmaul says 'Hello. Please feel free to browse. We make the finest boots in all of Antonica.'

You say, 'I need treant wood.'

: Gerault Takenmaul says 'Looking for Treant material? I do not work with such material. Ask Rodgar. I believe he is upstairs.'

''[[Rodgar the Tall]] is located at -80, -10 upstairs in The Cobbler in North Qeynos.''

You say, 'Hail, Rodgar the Tall'

: Rodgar the Tall says 'Greetings, ______! You look like you could use some new footwear.'

You say, 'I need treant wood.'

: Rodgar the Tall says 'What is all this talk of Treant Wood? I can get you some. In about two months, I shall have a new stock. Perhaps I may have some to trade... if you do me a [favor]...'

You say, 'What favor?'

: Rodgar the Tall says 'I will be glad to part with some Treant Wood for an Odus Pearl from the waters surrounding Erudin. On second thought... make that four Odus Pearls.'

'''Hand Rodgar 4 x [[Pearl of Odus]].'''<br>
''(This step can be used to raise a few factions. It can be done at Apprehensive, possibly lower. You can fill your bags with Pearl of Odus and turn them all in, 4 at a time, for the stackable, not lore, Wooden Shards and return to Erudin with multiple shards)''

: Rodgar the Tall says 'Wonderful!! I am sure that was a lot safer than battling a treant.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Qeynos]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Circle Of Unseen Hands]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Antonius Bayle]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Coalition of Tradefolk]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Guards of Qeynos]] got better.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

'''You receive [[Wooden Shards]]. Return to Emil Parsini and hand it to him.'''<br>
''(If you are doing this for faction, you MUST only give him ONE Wooden Shards per trade and will only receive one of the LORE resin)''

: Emil Parsini says 'Wonderful work!! These shards will work nicely. Here you are then. I found a few flasks of treant resin in the back. You can have one. Thanks again. It kept me from having to go out and hunt treants.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Merchants of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Council of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Guard of Erudin]] got better.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

'''You receive Treant Resin. Combine the resin and a Pearl of Odus in the Peacekeeper Staff container to craft a non-container [[Peacekeeper Staff]]. You can return to Lumi Stergnon and hand this in for faction, some XP, some coin and a rusty weapon, or simply use the Staff.'''

: Lumi Stergnon says 'You have done well, my child. Let me add the touch of harmony to finish the job.. Here, then. Take these supplies. I am sure you'll need them. Soon you may be able to assist us in [important missions].'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standing with [[Peace Keepers]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[High Council of Erudin]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Heretics]] got worse.
</div>
{{YouGainExperience}}

You receive 11 silver, 12 copper from Lumi Stergnon.

You receive a random piece of [[Patchwork Armor]]

